{{!
    @template tool_vae/coverage

    The coverage of a dossier: ahead of it, the box of the addresses where the certifiers publish their rule (when the
    site opened them), then the section: its heading, a sentence, and for each record its heading, its provenance line,
    the note that it has blocs, and its table. Nothing when there is no record. Inside the box the parts touch, with
    nothing between them but the spaces of before: a comment carries each line break there.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\coverage. The template holds no logic. Every text
    and address is escaped (double braces). Four keys are HTML (triple braces): headinghtml and titlehtml, headings made by
    the core ($output->heading(), the title of a record escaped by the class); provenancehtml, drawn by the template
    tool_vae/provenance; tablehtml, a table drawn by the template tool_vae/table (its cells by tool_vae/coverage_label and
    tool_vae/cell_content).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * show - bool, whether there is a coverage to draw
    * rulerefs - false, or {label, lines, sentence}: lines - array of {code, links}; links - array of {first (bool), url,
      title, tip, checked (false or {text})}
    * headinghtml - HTML, the heading of the section
    * intro - string, the sentence under it
    * fiches - array of {titlehtml, provenancehtml (false or HTML), blocnote (false or a string), tablehtml}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "show": true,
        "rulerefs": {"label": "Rule of validation", "sentence": "The plugin applies no rule.", "lines": [
            {"code": "RS00000", "links": [{"first": true, "url": "https://example.org/a", "title": "Rule", "tip":
                "https://example.org/a", "checked": {"text": "checked on 20 October 2026"} }] }
        ]},
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Coverage</h3>",
        "intro": "Counts, nothing else.",
        "fiches": [
            {"titlehtml": "<h4>RS00000 — RS</h4>", "provenancehtml": false, "blocnote": "This record has blocs.",
                "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable tool-vae-coverage-table\"><tbody><tr><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table>"}
        ]
    }
}}
{{#show}}
{{#rulerefs}}
<div class="small border rounded p-2 my-2 tool-vae-rule-refs"><strong>{{label}}</strong><ul class="mb-1">{{!
}}{{#lines}}<li><strong>{{code}}</strong> : {{#links}}{{^first}} ; {{/first}}{{!
}}<a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="{{tip}}">{{title}}</a>{{!
}}{{#checked}} {{text}}{{/checked}}{{/links}}</li>{{/lines}}</ul><p class="mb-0">{{sentence}}</p></div>
{{/rulerefs}}
<section class="tool-vae-coverage mb-4">
{{{headinghtml}}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#fiches}}
{{{titlehtml}}}
{{#provenancehtml}}
{{{provenancehtml}}}
{{/provenancehtml}}
{{#blocnote}}
<p class="small text-muted">{{blocnote}}</p>
{{/blocnote}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/fiches}}
</section>
{{/show}}
